# AI Video Generator - Project Overview

This is an enterprise-grade AI video generation platform with dual workflows, cloud GPU acceleration, and comprehensive monitoring capabilities.

## 🏗️ Core Architecture

### Backend Structure (FastAPI + Python)
- **Entry Point**: [backend/main.py](mdc:backend/main.py) - Application startup
- **Core App**: [backend/app.py](mdc:backend/app.py) - FastAPI application factory
- **Configuration**: [backend/core/config.py](mdc:backend/core/config.py) - Environment-based config management
- **Database**: [backend/database.py](mdc:backend/database.py) - PostgreSQL job persistence (MANDATORY)
- **Job Queue**: [backend/job_queue_unified.py](mdc:job_queue_unified.py) - Unified job processing system

### Frontend Structure (React + TypeScript + Tailwind)
- **Entry Point**: [frontend/src/main.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/main.tsx) - React application entry
- **Main App**: [frontend/src/App.tsx](mdc:frontend/src/App.tsx) - Routing and layout
- **Components**: [frontend/src/components/](mdc:frontend/src/components/) - Reusable UI components
- **Pages**: [frontend/src/pages/](mdc:frontend/src/pages/) - Main application pages

## 🎬 Video Generation Workflows

### 1. MoneyPrinter Flow
- **Purpose**: AI script generation + stock footage + subtitles + optional music
- **Backend**: [backend/vendors/AIvideos/](mdc:backend/vendors/AIvideos/) - Core implementation
- **API Endpoint**: `/api/moneyprinter/generate`
- **Process**: Subject → AI Script → Search Terms → Stock Videos → TTS → Subtitles → Composition

### 2. Brainrot Flow  
- **Purpose**: TikTok-style compilation videos from YouTube URLs
- **Backend**: [backend/vendors/Compilation/](mdc:backend/vendors/Compilation/) - Core implementation
- **API Endpoint**: `/api/brainrot/generate`
- **Process**: YouTube URL → Download → Scene Detection → Splitting → Compilation Creation

