## 🚀 Enterprise Features

### Cloud GPU Acceleration
- **Modal Integration**: Cloud GPU processing with L40S/A100/H100
- **Hybrid Processing**: Automatic fallback to local processing
- **Cost Optimization**: Pay-per-use GPU time

### Monitoring & Observability
- **Metrics**: [backend/metrics.py](mdc:backend/metrics.py) - Prometheus metrics
- **Logging**: [backend/logging_config.py](mdc:backend/logging_config.py) - Structured logging
- **Error Handling**: [backend/utils/error_handling.py](mdc:backend/utils/error_handling.py) - Standardized errors

### Performance & Scaling
- **Caching**: Multi-level caching (Memory/Redis/File)
- **Job Queue**: Redis-based with worker distribution
- **Batch Processing**: Bulk video generation support
- **Database**: PostgreSQL with connection pooling

